            "review_title": "Review at Bready Banh Mi Tuoi",
            "review_text": "kcarters\nPeterborough, United Kingdom270 contributions\n0\nI asked tripadvisor to put this place on their site!\nMar 2018 • Family\nWhat can I say...I come here so often when I am in hcm. It’s a bakery that is virtually always open churning out the best bread and cakes downstairs in factory levels. All good and high quality.\n\nThen you go upstairs and you have the restaurant. Only ever ordered the Vietnamese full English. It’s got a lot of everything from bacon and egg to pate, steak, pickled carrot, cheese and other stuff. It’s actually brilliant with their bread and an iced coffee. It’s not a full English but it’s not a let down by any chance.\n\nI will get a photo for these guys and try to find out their opening times...which seems to be always\nRead more\nWritten March 31, 2018",
